
Escalation End Event ->
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is the component that allows you to escalate an exception when an integration process ends.
You can use this component to indicate a critical error condition or a failure of a process that requires attention.
Using an Escalation End Event to end the vel message with an escalated status and persist it for monitoring and alerting.


